   "text": "The report file is only created\nwhen missing, never cleared. Every\nsweep adds to the end of whatever\nis already there.",
   "rawText": "The report file is only created\nwhen missing, never cleared. Every\nsweep adds to the end of whatever\nis already there.",
   "fontSize": 20,
